<title>NEW ZEALAND: Taylors yr net profit rises to NZ$1.2 mln.</title>
<headline>Taylors yr net profit rises to NZ$1.2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year result to Dec 31</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    1.22 vs 0.79</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    5.0 vs 3.2</p>
<p>    Div (cents)			    2.5 vs 2.0</p>
<p>    Turnover				16.8 vs 14.0</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			  1.8 vs 1.2</p>
<p>    Tax					0.6 vs 0.4</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)    24.3 vs 24.3</p>
<p>Dividend carries full imputation credits.</p>
<p>Pay date March 26</p>
<p>Reg date March 14</p>
<p>    Ex div   March 17</p>
<p>Note - Taylors Group Ltd is a drycleaning and laundry operator. -- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
